{ (A) (version=4 dontdraw) gridmatrix dup /pixs get exch /pixx get centrelid } 0 isEqual  % Level 5
{ 900 { pop 16#80 } filled (eclevel=2 dontdraw) gridmatrix dup /pixs get exch /pixx get centrelid } 3 isEqual  % Level 2

